name rank-2-roots
category Package
revision 61719
shortdesc Draw (mathematical) rank 2 root systems
longdesc This package concerns mathematical drawings arising in
longdesc representation theory. The purpose of this package is to ease
longdesc drawing of rank 2 root systems, with Weyl chambers, weight
longdesc lattices, and parabolic subgroups. Required packages are tikz,
longdesc etoolbox, expl3, pgfkeys, pgfopts, xparse, and xstring.
